  <front>
    <title>Creation of a Registry for smime-type Parameter Values</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="7114" stream="IETF"/>
    <author fullname="B. Leiba" initials="B." surname="Leiba">
      <organization showOnFrontPage="true">Huawei Technologies</organization>
      <address/>
    </author>
    <date year="2014" month="January"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">Secure/Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions (S/MIME) defined the
Content-Type parameter &quot;smime-type&quot;.  As the list of defined values
for that parameter has increased, it has become clear that a registry
is needed to document these values.  This document creates the
registry, registers the current values, and specifies the policies
for registration of new values.</t>
    </abstract>
